# Cloudflare rejects absolute URLs in the SOURCE column here — sources
# must be relative paths on this same hostname. Only same-hostname
# relative-path rules belong in this file.
#
# www -> apex is handled by a Cloudflare Redirect Rule in the dashboard,
# not by this file (it would need an absolute-URL source, which this file
# can't express).
#
# OwlMD legacy URLs live on a different hostname and must also be handled
# by a Cloudflare Redirect Rule, for the same reason.
